<section class="container py-5"><div class="card border-0 shadow-lg rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5 mx-auto" style="max-width:540px">
<h1 class="h3 fw-bold" style="color:#13315c">Esqueci minha senha</h1><p>Informe seu e-mail para solicitar um código de recuperação.</p>
<form method="post" action="/esqueci-senha"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{csrfToken}}">
<label class="form-label" for="recoveryEmail">E-mail</label><input class="form-control mb-3" id="recoveryEmail" name="email" type="email" maxlength="160" autocomplete="email" required>
<div hidden><input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div>
<button class="btn btn-primary w-100" type="submit" style="background:#13315c">Enviar código</button></form>
<a class="mt-3" href="/users/login">Voltar ao login</a></div></section>
